00:31:44.220 --> 00:31:48.360
I think that there should have been, like, a whole, like, life simulator.

00:31:48.780 --> 00:31:50.320
Like, I think you don't do this.

00:31:50.800 --> 00:31:52.640
Don't change the concept of the game.

00:31:52.740 --> 00:31:55.420
I'm just saying, with the game as it was, right?

00:31:55.580 --> 00:32:01.520
Like, there's six keys, so obviously it's like, you know, you can't add another ride or whatever.

00:32:01.720 --> 00:32:09.720
But, like, I think that the star thing, being the currency system, could have been, like, there could have been an actual shop, right?

00:32:09.720 --> 00:32:13.540
Because it's, like, half the thing that you do is shopping in the Magic Kingdom.

00:32:13.640 --> 00:32:16.360
Everybody loves to go to the Magic Kingdom and everybody loves to shop.

00:32:16.620 --> 00:32:18.640
Those are their favorite things to do.

00:32:18.840 --> 00:32:20.440
So why did they put that in the game?

00:32:20.600 --> 00:32:24.180
There could have been, like, a save room and it's just, like, one of the hotels.

00:32:26.560 --> 00:32:28.720
There could have been multiple...

00:32:29.560 --> 00:32:31.780
A firework show? Yeah, a firework show.

00:32:32.040 --> 00:32:34.600
Like, you don't even get to see the parade, by the way.

00:32:34.600 --> 00:32:48.540
Like, this is all for a parade and you just get, like, an end screen with your nameless boy with Mickey Mouse and Goofy and whoever the hell.

00:32:49.000 --> 00:32:51.040
And that's supposed to be it.

00:32:51.340 --> 00:32:56.380
Yeah, they even tease you with, like, you see a couple members of the band with Mickey.

00:32:56.580 --> 00:32:59.480
Yeah. They just sort of come out and then the game ends.

00:32:59.620 --> 00:33:03.500
I would have liked a proper ending scene.

00:33:03.920 --> 00:33:08.440
You know, do the credits over it if you need and just have, like, different floats.

00:33:08.960 --> 00:33:12.980
It would be cool to see, like, the Disney princesses walking around and they'd be like,

00:33:13.120 --> 00:33:14.000
What are you doing here?

00:33:14.160 --> 00:33:15.360
Like, you know, park's closed.

00:33:15.600 --> 00:33:16.540
Get out of here.

00:33:16.780 --> 00:33:18.740
And they're, like, having a smoke break or something.

00:33:18.920 --> 00:33:19.820
Like, that would have been cool.

00:33:20.440 --> 00:33:23.400
I'm going to show you just how much Disney trivia I know.

00:33:23.620 --> 00:33:27.260
So at the end of the game, when you do see those members of the band and everything,

00:33:27.500 --> 00:33:31.140
Mickey is also the conductor and he's wearing a specific outfit.

00:33:31.140 --> 00:33:37.300
And that outfit is actually from the Mickey Mouse cartoon The Band Concert from 1935.

00:33:37.960 --> 00:33:40.460
And I'm not reading Wikipedia.

00:33:40.480 --> 00:33:41.800
It sounds like you're reading Wikipedia.

00:33:42.020 --> 00:33:48.460
No. The reason I know this is because that is, the band concert is the first appearance of Donald Duck.

00:33:48.820 --> 00:33:51.400
Wow. I'm not going to lie.

00:33:51.400 --> 00:33:57.020
I'm pretty sure that's the exact suit he's wearing because that's what they traced for the art.

00:33:57.940 --> 00:33:58.840
Yeah, probably.

00:34:00.220 --> 00:34:05.400
But, you know, what's funny is the band concert, speaking of the old cartoon and everything,

00:34:05.620 --> 00:34:12.620
I remember, this is a long time ago now, but I watched it because I was, like, watching first appearance of all different kinds of cartoon characters.

00:34:12.620 --> 00:34:19.420
And when you see something from 1935 and it's a Mickey Mouse cartoon and, you know, Mickey Mouse cartoons, they don't make those anymore.

00:34:19.620 --> 00:34:21.800
They're purposely trying to, like, hide Mickey.

00:34:21.980 --> 00:34:23.580
He's, like, too successful now.

00:34:23.580 --> 00:34:27.500
And they're, like, we can't make a bad thing with Mickey Mouse and we just don't make anything at all.

00:34:27.580 --> 00:34:29.340
That's why there's never been a Mickey Mouse movie.

00:34:29.560 --> 00:34:32.020
Well, that's why that one video game came out.

00:34:32.400 --> 00:34:33.700
Epic Mickey. Everybody loved it.

00:34:34.020 --> 00:34:36.080
Yeah, exactly, because they only had one shot.

00:34:36.080 --> 00:34:40.360
But, anyway, my point being, the band concert was actually hysterical.

00:34:40.520 --> 00:34:46.280
I had a great time. I actually thought Donald Duck was very funny in it, and it held up 70, 80, 90 years later.

00:34:46.420 --> 00:34:47.680
So, pretty cool.

00:34:47.940 --> 00:34:50.040
So, this is you pitching that cartoon?

00:34:50.480 --> 00:34:52.960
To people. It's a recommendation, Sean.

