Right, that's what I'm saying.

00:35:31.120 --> 00:35:33.920
Like, those straps are black, and they're part of...

00:35:33.920 --> 00:35:35.340
His skin? Like, they're blending in.

00:35:35.340 --> 00:35:36.980
Yeah, no, they're just blending in.

00:35:37.040 --> 00:35:38.660
You don't see them because they're the same color.

00:35:39.000 --> 00:35:41.700
Hmm. But you know what I'm putting down, right?

00:35:41.880 --> 00:35:44.160
I think that's, like, they're, like, they're...

00:35:44.160 --> 00:35:46.540
Or they would be for suspenders if he had them.

00:35:46.540 --> 00:35:47.360
If he had them.

00:35:47.820 --> 00:35:48.760
Yeah. Maybe.

